<<<readme>>>
## LLM (OpenAI)

The agent thinks with OpenAI via `@wappa/openai`. Set `OPENAI_API_KEY` in `.env`
(create a key at <https://platform.openai.com/api-keys>). To change models,
pass `new OpenAIProvider({ model: '...' })`; pass `baseURL` to use any
OpenAI-compatible server (Ollama, vLLM, llama.cpp, ...).
